  "notes": "Adds116 sourced definitions, completing183 archived USGS fields while legacy49 fields stay at v1. Source-backed role curation excludes numeric-looking identities, QA flags, comments and preparation metadata from measurements. Depth references and biological contexts are separate; coordinate units remain unknown and source datum labels remain literal. Definitions are not source-data accuracy, rights, approval, Qwen review, scientific comparability or publication authority. Original records were read only through the existing public reader with read-only SQLite. Fresh and historical instances may represent the same source identities; no claim of 1,000 distinct records is made. Narrow v1 fallback reconstructs old role/context/bin behavior, not imported profile claims. Agent review does not replace human review. Initial focused expectations and malformed synthetic QA receipt were corrected; malformed receipt remains explicitly rejected in final browser checks. No native write, source admission, service change, AI batch or deployment included."
